 core: `Your Jupiter and Mercury are trine, 120 degrees of natural flow in the same elemental family. Your capacity for expansion and how you think are drawing from the same source. Your philosophical instinct and your cognitive function recognize each other as kin. Optimism and thinking move in the same current without friction. This aspect produces intellectual confidence that feels effortless. You think big because your mind and your expansive sense trust each other. The ease is real but it's also the limit.`,
